
# Local Agent OS runtime state
.agent-os/tasks.db
.agent-os/fleet/
# Fleet workers write per-task state into the workspace they are running in,
# which for this repository is this repository. These are keyed by task id and
# are recreated on every run, so they are runtime state rather than work:
#   .agent-os-progress-t_<id>.json  per-step checkpoint the next harness reads
#   .agent-os-local-t_<id>/         the worker's own scratch directory
# Task deliverables are deliberately NOT matched here. A worker's actual output
# should be reviewable, and hiding it behind an ignore rule is how real work
# gets lost.
.agent-os-progress-t_*.json
.agent-os-local-t_*/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
